id: pm-jev-7esl
title: Compare frozen decision proposals before adopting a local policy
description: "Offline decision-policy replay. Replay recorded minimized inputs against a selected local policy/model version and compare proposal changes before adoption. Acceptance: no live provider calls during replay; missing inputs yield gaps; old/new disagreement and abstention counts are exact. Include typed SDK, CLI TOON/JSON, typed remedies, docs/example, fixture-adapter tests, public-tracker read-only no-git validation, and local tev1:4b agreement/latency evidence. Overlap checked against CLI source/docs, pm-jev evaluation/calibration and cost-policy surfaces, pm-rl training/promotion and evaluation plans, and pm-rlm recursive ledger replay. Existing evaluation targets labelled quality; this adds deployment compatibility inspection. RLM reconstructs recursive execution, a different ledger. Reuse typed decision validation/transport and host command rendering; do not duplicate SDK tracker behavior."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
